            <title>[IGNITE-6262] TxPessimisticDeadlockDetectionTest.testDeadlocksPartitionedNear and TxPessimisticDeadlockDetectionTest.testDeadlocksReplicated  is failing flaky.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6262</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The problem and the solution are the same with &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5865&quot; title=&quot;TxOptimisticDeadlockDetectionTest.testDeadlocksPartitioned is failing&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-5865&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-5865&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

